Conclusion
The proposed Market Intelligence Analytics System demonstrates how reliable financial data can be transformed into meaningful management insights. Through repeatable data ingestion, validated financial metrics and interactive Power BI dashboards, the project establishes a practical foundation for monitoring market trends, macroeconomic conditions and volatility. The implemented proofs of concept confirm technical feasibility, while documented quality controls, AI validation and leadership standards support transparency and accountability. Although further automation and governance would be required for production deployment, the solution provides a structured foundation for future financial performance benchmarking at Really Big Bank.



 

